.TH stralloc_expand 3
.SH NAME
stralloc_expand \- expand environment variables in a stralloc
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "stralloc.h"
.PP
.BI "int stralloc_expand(stralloc *" sa ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B stralloc_expand
replaces environment variable references in
.I sa
(e.g., %VAR%) with their corresponding values (on Windows platforms).
It updates the stralloc in place.